    {
     "raw": "]Wn 03[",
     "command": "W"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Slipping deep into your Mega Soundchair, you sip down an"
    },
    {
     "raw": "insta-cocoa from your dispenser.  The whole universe is"
    },
    {
     "raw": "erupting in a fanfare of joy and hope."
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "Still, one burning thought enters your mind:"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Why am I reading this?"
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "If only you could find a way out of this crazy universe and"
    },
    {
     "raw": "avoid the horrible, smiling face of Transon Lohk."
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]P 005[",
     "command": "P"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]Wn 03[",
     "command": "W"
    },
    {
     "raw": "The universe has asked you to save them one too many times,"
    },
    {
     "raw": "and you've decided to hide out on Tyrian and reflect on"
    },
    {
     "raw": "your Hazudra friend who died way back in Episode 1."
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "Dang.  Can't even remember his name now."
