  {
   "section": 41,
   "marker": "** 41 * Special Ending",
   "lines": [
    {
     "raw": "]P 005[",
     "command": "P"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]M 037[",
     "command": "M"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]Wn 03[",
     "command": "W"
    },
    {
     "raw": "This is no work of Microsol!  Who could have built that"
    },
    {
     "raw": "incredible ship?  What has this planet done to my ship?"
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "Whatever it was, you have no time to ponder, for in front"
    },
    {
     "raw": "of you stands a giant purple stargate!"
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "Can it be... a way out?"
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]P 005[",
     "command": "P"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]Wn 03[",
     "command": "W"
    },
    {
     "raw": "With no effort to decide, you know you must enter the gate,"
    },
    {
     "raw": "for it may be the only way out."
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "Your ships' engines screaming against the atmosphere of the"
    },
    {
     "raw": "planet, you plunge into the gateway."
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "Just at the crucial moment you yell:"
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]F[",
     "command": "F"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]P 000[ Load TSHP2.PCX",
     "command": "P"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]Wn 03[",
     "command": "W"
    },
    {
     "raw": "NOT ZINGLON!!!"
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]J 043[",
     "command": "J"
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    }
   ]
