  {
   "section": 48,
   "marker": "**48 * Normal Ending",
   "lines": [
    {
     "raw": "]P 005[",
     "command": "P"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]M 040[",
     "command": "M"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]Wn 03[",
     "command": "W"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Now that I have won the war, I can return to Savara"
    },
    {
     "raw": "and receive a hero's welcome!  Millions of"
    },
    {
     "raw": "Holo-viewers will bow at my feet and bless the very"
    },
    {
     "raw": "channels I appear on."
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "Sages will cross a thousand desert streams to be"
    },
    {
     "raw": "at my side.  Streams of small dwarves will dance the"
    },
    {
     "raw": "jig of a thousand hours at my celebration.  I could"
    },
    {
     "raw": "be made into anything."
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]P 005[",
     "command": "P"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]Wn 03[",
     "command": "W"
    },
    {
     "raw": "But I don't want to be a hero.  I hate this life."
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "Why, O me, do I strut upon this stage once more?"
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "That's it..."
    },
    {
     "raw": ""
    },
    {
     "raw": "   I won't go!"
    },
    {
     "raw": "#"
    },
    {
     "raw": "]P 005[",
     "command": "P"
    },
    {
